@startuml 16_State_Problem_Lifecycle
title Problem Lifecycle - State Diagram

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
    BorderColor DarkSlateGray
    ArrowColor DarkSlateGray
    FontSize 12
}

[*] --> Pending : User submits problem\n(CreateProblemCommand)

state Pending {
    Pending : Problem record created\nin database
    Pending : Image not yet uploaded
    Pending : Status = 0 (Pending)
}

state Processing {
    Processing : Image uploaded to storage
    Processing : OCR extraction started\n(TrOCR model)
    Processing : Status = 1 (Processing)
    Processing : Background task running
}

state Completed {
    Completed : ExtractedText populated
    Completed : Solution steps generated
    Completed : CompletedAt timestamp set
    Completed : Status = 2 (Completed)
}

state Failed {
    Failed : OCR or solving failed
    Failed : Error details recorded\nin ProblemHistory
    Failed : Status = 3 (Failed)
}

state Deleted {
    Deleted : Soft deleted or\nhard deleted from DB
    Deleted : Image file removed\nfrom storage
}

Pending --> Processing : User uploads image\n(UploadImageCommand)\n[image quality >= threshold]

Processing --> Completed : OCR + solving\nsuccessful\n(UpdateProblemStatusCommand\nstatus=Completed)

Processing --> Failed : OCR or model\nfails or times out\n(UpdateProblemStatusCommand\nstatus=Failed)

Failed --> Processing : User retries problem\n(RetryProblemCommand\nRevertToPending → re-upload)

Pending --> Deleted : User deletes\nbefore upload\n(DeleteProblemCommand)

Completed --> Deleted : User deletes\ncompleted problem\n(DeleteProblemCommand)

Failed --> Deleted : User deletes\nfailed problem\n(DeleteProblemCommand)

Deleted --> [*]
Completed --> [*] : (persisted)

note right of Pending
  **Entry Actions:**
  Problem.Create() called
  DomainEvent: ProblemCreated
  ProblemHistory.Create(Action="Created")
end note

note right of Processing
  **Entry Actions:**
  problem.SetImage(imagePath)
  problem.SetProcessing()
  DomainEvent: ProblemProcessingStarted
  ProblemHistory.Create(Action="ProcessingStarted")
  MLServiceClient.ExtractTextAsync() called
end note

note right of Completed
  **Entry Actions:**
  problem.SetCompleted(extractedText)
  DomainEvent: ProblemCompleted
  ProblemHistory.Create(Action="Completed")
  Push notification sent to user
end note

note right of Failed
  **Entry Actions:**
  problem.SetFailed()
  DomainEvent: ProblemFailed
  ProblemHistory.Create(Action="Failed")
  Error logged to Serilog
end note

@enduml
